I've updated the following patches to 3.4.3:

* Lenses patch - converts several rings into magical lenses and adds a
couple of new ones. (This one affects save compatibility.)

* Poisoned weapons patch - allows arrows to be 'poisoned' with potions
of sleeping, confusion and paralysis

* Statue patch - states are now draw using monster glyphs (TTY only)

* Combined alchemy patch - a combination of Nephi's colour alchemy
patch (1.2) and my gem/acid alchemy patch.

* Cancellation patch - Monsters can use wands of cancellation. Hostile
cancellation cancels one item in your inventory (at random). DSM when
cancelled reverts to scales.

All these patches are available from my web page [1].

